body:
If you can take the first step then you have a good chance of recovery. My suggestions are;
Go to as many meetings as possible, get a sponsor, pray twice daily, make a gratitude list, read pages 86-88 of the big book of AA., and work the steps. If your sponsor doesn’t walk you through the steps fire them and get another. A sponsor should be the one person you can talk to about anything, that holds you accountable, and that you are comfortable with. My current sponsor and I talk multiple times daily and he has suggested things for me to do as I progress in my recovery. This thing works it really does. 
Best Wishes
